# AI Capabilities

This document defines the AI capabilities that may be associated with an impact.

## Generative AI

Creates new content such as text, images, audio, video, or code.

## Computer Vision

Analyzes and interprets images and videos.

## Natural Language Processing (NLP)

Understands, processes, and generates human language.

## Speech & Audio

Speech recognition, speech synthesis, and audio analysis.

## Recommendation Systems

Suggests products, content, or decisions based on data.

## Predictive Analytics

Forecasts outcomes using historical data.

## Robotics

Controls or assists physical machines and robots.

## Autonomous Systems

Makes decisions and acts with limited or no human intervention.

## Decision Support

Provides recommendations to assist human decision-making.

## Knowledge Retrieval

Searches, retrieves, and summarizes information.

## Multi-Agent Systems

Coordinates multiple AI agents to solve complex tasks.

## Optimization

Improves schedules, logistics, resource allocation, or processes.
